{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa: Dinner for Four"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "I'm so full"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Looking to the Stars > Florence Nightingale"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Identify and describe personal and regional eating habits and cooking in a range of communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le03ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressing Necessity"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "\u201cHave got to\u201d is used to express necessity.<br /> \u201cGoing to have to\u201d expresses a necessary action in the future or a condition."}, {"type": "text", "content": "\u201cHave got to\u201d has irregular forms in the past and future. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "\u201cGoing to have to\u201d also expresses a necessary action in the future. It's also used as a conditional for a resulting action. Look at the chart below."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I have got to go to the gym before dinner. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">  I had to go to the gym before dinner. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Future (will)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I will have to go to the gym after dinner. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Future (going to)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'm going to have to go to the gym more often. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Conditional\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Because I ate so much, I'm going to have to go to the gym tomorrow. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " What did you used to do?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " \u201cUsed to\u201d and \u201cwould\u201d express a pattern of action that occurred regularly in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">How did you used to get to school before you got a bicycle?<br /> I used to get up really early to take the bus. or<br />   I used to get up early, and I would take my bike out of the locker.<br /> I would put on my helmet and ride all the way to school.</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scrumptious"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes food that tastes very good"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter enjoyed a scrumptious meal prepared by Vanessa."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about food customs in celebrations."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "workout"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an exercise routine"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's good to do a workout the day after a big meal."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to experience"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do or feel something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter thinks everyone should experience Vanessa's wonderful cooking."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name