"slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le03ob03re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le03ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "", "image": "engenn6le03ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le03ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, I'm so full. I can't eat any more.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: I've got to stop eating. Thank you, Vanessa. That was a scrumptious meal.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, I'm glad you guys enjoyed it. It's too bad John and Sandra couldn't come.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: They're going to have to come over some other time to experience your cooking."}, {"time": "16700", "image": "engenn6le03ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'll need to do a workout at the gym tomorrow.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I used to go to the gym before I started this job. I would work out four times a week.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Did you know that Indian Hindu wedding celebrations go on for days? Imagine the continuous feast.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: I used to have a roommate who was Indian. She and her family would eat meals with their fingers. That seems much easier."}, {"time": "39000", "image": "engenn6le03ob03re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: The Greeks also have elaborate wedding parties with a lot of food and dancing.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Imagine if an Indian married a Greek.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: I would try to get invited to that wedding.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: We've got to have ice cream still.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: There is always space for a little ice cream."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "c